WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:33.041
<b>In the previous verse, Lord Krishna explained</b>

2
00:00:33.041 --> 00:00:36.458
<b>that in whatever way people take refuge in Him,</b>

3
00:00:36.458 --> 00:00:39.833
<b>He rewards them accordingly.</b>

4
00:00:39.833 --> 00:00:41.750
<b>But if that is the case,</b>

5
00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:45.625
<b>then why isn't the entire human race </b>
<b>to seek Lord Krishna's  grace,</b>

6
00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:49.500
<b>standing before him with folded hands?</b>

7
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:52.791
<b>This verse answers that very question.</b>

8
00:00:57.541 --> 00:00:59.833
<b>In this verse, Lord Krishna says</b>

9
00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:08.416
<b>that those who desire worldly success in return </b>
<b>for their actions worship various deities.</b>

10
00:01:08.416 --> 00:01:14.625
<b>This is because, on this path, </b>
<b>they obtain quick results.</b>

11
00:01:14.625 --> 00:01:16.708
<b>Now, understand one thing here,</b>

12
00:01:16.708 --> 00:01:21.708
<b>which might also answer the questions that may </b>
<b>have arisen in your mind from the previous verse. </b>

13
00:01:21.708 --> 00:01:23.250
<b>Lord Krishna had said</b>

14
00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:26.250
<b>that in whatever way a </b>
<b>person takes refuge in Him,</b>

15
00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:29.791
<b>He rewards them accordingly.</b>

16
00:01:29.791 --> 00:01:34.416
<b>So does this mean that whatever you want, </b>
<b>you will get it?</b>

17
00:01:34.416 --> 00:01:37.208
<b>Even if it's to your detriment?</b>

18
00:01:37.208 --> 00:01:39.458
<b>That wouldn't be right, would it? </b>

19
00:01:39.458 --> 00:01:42.750
<b>For example, if an unhealthy child</b>

20
00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:45.000
<b>suffering from a cold and cough</b>

21
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:49.750
<b>starts insisting to their mother that they want </b>
<b>to eat cold ice cream,</b>

22
00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:53.083
<b>would it be right to fulfill that child's wish?</b>

23
00:01:53.083 --> 00:01:54.375
<b>No, right?</b>

24
00:01:54.375 --> 00:01:58.916
<b>That mother will first give medicines to</b>
<b>improve her child's health, </b>

25
00:01:58.916 --> 00:02:03.625
<b>and once the health is restored, she will </b>
<b>then fulfill the desire for ice cream.</b>

26
00:02:03.625 --> 00:02:09.958
<b>The only thing here is that it might take a </b>
<b>little time for that desire to be fulfilled.</b>

27
00:02:09.958 --> 00:02:11.000
<b>Similarly,</b>

28
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:13.291
<b>Lord Krishna, who has the well-being</b>
<b>of all of us in mind,</b>

29
00:02:13.291 --> 00:02:17.458
<b>knows what is right for us and what is not.</b>

30
00:02:17.458 --> 00:02:20.541
<b>So, He first purifies our minds,</b>

31
00:02:20.541 --> 00:02:27.458
<b>makes them completely healthy, and </b>
<b>then fulfills whatever our desire may be.</b>

32
00:02:27.458 --> 00:02:32.041
<b>Yes, but this process might take some time.</b>

33
00:02:32.041 --> 00:02:34.000
<b>Listen to one more story.</b>

34
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:40.500
<b>Once, a desire arose in Dhruv's mind that he </b>
<b>wanted a kingdom greater than even Brahma's.</b>

35
00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:43.791
<b>Driven by this desire, he performed rituals,</b>

36
00:02:43.791 --> 00:02:45.250
<b>did deep penance,</b>

37
00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:49.333
<b>and dedicated all his time and </b>
<b>attention to Lord Krishna.</b>

38
00:02:49.333 --> 00:02:51.875
<b>And when Lord Krishna appeared and asked,</b>

39
00:02:51.875 --> 00:02:54.333
<b>"Ask, Dhruv, what do you want?"</b>

40
00:02:54.333 --> 00:02:55.625
<b>Dhruv said,</b>

41
00:02:55.625 --> 00:02:58.250
<b>"Lord, now I don't want anything.</b>

42
00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:01.125
<b>While contemplating on You, I have come to know</b>

43
00:03:01.125 --> 00:03:06.375
<b>that the one who has attained </b>
<b>You doesn't need any kingdom."</b>

44
00:03:06.375 --> 00:03:07.625
<b>Dhruv's heart</b>

45
00:03:07.625 --> 00:03:10.958
<b>had become completely pure in </b>
<b>the contemplation of Lord Krishna;</b>

46
00:03:10.958 --> 00:03:13.375
<b>he no longer craved a kingdom.</b>

47
00:03:13.375 --> 00:03:18.083
<b>And for this very reason, this was the </b>
<b>right time for him to become an excellent king.</b>

48
00:03:18.083 --> 00:03:24.250
<b>Now, without even asking, Krishna granted </b>
<b>him the boon to rule on this earth.</b>

49
00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:25.500
<b>Impatient people,</b>

50
00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:28.833
<b>in order to quickly attain their worldly rewards,</b>

51
00:03:28.833 --> 00:03:33.666
<b>overlook the path of complete spiritual </b>
<b>purification towards Lord Krishna.</b>

52
00:03:33.666 --> 00:03:36.500
<b>They start worshipping deities,</b>

53
00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:38.791
<b>perform many religious rituals,</b>

54
00:03:38.791 --> 00:03:44.916
<b>and the deities, being pleased, grant them </b>
<b>the fruits of these worldly desires.</b>

55
00:03:44.916 --> 00:03:50.416
<b>The only difference is that </b>
<b>you will get what you want,</b>

56
00:03:50.416 --> 00:03:55.250
<b>but then the responsibility for </b>
<b>your profit and loss is yours.</b>

57
00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:57.166
<b>Not of the deities.</b>

58
00:03:57.166 --> 00:03:58.708
<b>This path is short,</b>

59
00:03:58.708 --> 00:04:01.083
<b>seems suitable from a materialistic perspective,</b>

60
00:04:01.083 --> 00:04:04.625
<b>which is why most people follow this path.</b>

61
00:04:04.625 --> 00:04:05.500
<b>But</b>

62
00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:09.583
<b>for complete spiritual purification, </b>
<b>one will have to give time,</b>

63
00:04:09.583 --> 00:04:13.333
<b>engage the mind in Lord Krishna.</b>

64
00:04:18.041 --> 00:04:23.208
<b>Some people dedicate time for </b>
<b>complete spiritual purification</b>

65
00:04:23.208 --> 00:04:25.791
<b>and follow my path,</b>

66
00:04:25.791 --> 00:04:26.958
<b>but</b>

67
00:04:26.958 --> 00:04:33.583
<b>many who desire material and </b>
<b>worldly fruits do not choose this path.</b>

68
00:04:33.583 --> 00:04:35.166
<b>Remember,</b>

69
00:04:35.166 --> 00:04:38.750
<b>to construct a strong building,</b>

70
00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:43.416
<b>one has to dig deep foundations,</b>
<b>which takes time.</b>

71
00:04:43.416 --> 00:04:44.291
<b>On the other hand,</b>

72
00:04:44.291 --> 00:04:48.458
<b>it doesn't take much time to build a house of mud,</b>

73
00:04:48.458 --> 00:04:50.125
<b>but</b>

74
00:04:50.125 --> 00:04:53.958
<b>it will be destroyed just as quickly.</b>

75
00:04:53.958 --> 00:04:56.916
<b>What do you want in your personal life?</b>

76
00:04:56.916 --> 00:04:59.500
<b>Temporary and momentary gains</b>

77
00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:02.791
<b>or permanent success and satisfaction?</b>

78
00:05:02.791 --> 00:05:07.375
<b>And how much time are you </b>
<b>prepared to give for this?</b>

79
00:05:07.375 --> 00:05:09.166
<b>Generally,</b>

80
00:05:09.166 --> 00:05:12.041
<b>in the desire to get immediate results,</b>

81
00:05:12.041 --> 00:05:13.083
<b>many people</b>

82
00:05:13.083 --> 00:05:18.583
<b>make such decisions that </b>
<b>give momentary happiness,</b>

83
00:05:18.583 --> 00:05:19.583
<b>but</b>

84
00:05:19.583 --> 00:05:26.541
<b>invaluable things like self-satisfaction </b>
<b>and honesty are lost.</b>

85
00:05:26.541 --> 00:05:29.416
<b>This only causes harm.</b>

86
00:05:29.416 --> 00:05:30.791
<b>For this reason,</b>

87
00:05:30.791 --> 00:05:34.333
<b>choose the path of disciplined austerity.</b>

88
00:05:34.333 --> 00:05:37.833
<b>This path will certainly cause some delay,</b>

89
00:05:37.833 --> 00:05:38.791
<b>but</b>

90
00:05:38.791 --> 00:05:44.041
<b>while walking on it, your mind </b>
<b>will also become pure.</b>

91
00:05:44.041 --> 00:05:50.333
<b>You will know what is </b>
<b>truly important for you in life,</b>

92
00:05:50.333 --> 00:05:51.458
<b>and then finally,</b>

93
00:05:51.458 --> 00:05:58.791
<b>the result you get will be extremely </b>
<b>beautiful and joyful.</b>

94
00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:00.375
<b>Remember,</b>

95
00:06:00.375 --> 00:06:08.875
<b>life values like patience, discipline, </b>
<b>and honesty purify your character</b>

96
00:06:08.875 --> 00:06:15.291
<b>and pave the way for a stable and content life.</b>

97
00:06:15.291 --> 00:06:21.791
<b>To imbibe these values in your life, </b>
<b>self-reflection is necessary,</b>

98
00:06:21.791 --> 00:06:27.041
<b>but along with that, meditation, study </b>
<b>of spiritual scriptures, </b>

99
00:06:27.041 --> 00:06:29.125
<b>like this Gita,</b>

100
00:06:29.125 --> 00:06:33.791
<b>following all these will also be extremely helpful.</b>

101
00:06:33.791 --> 00:06:38.166
<b>Build a strong edifice of success and character,</b>

102
00:06:38.166 --> 00:06:42.500
<b>not a mud house made of desires.</b>

103
00:06:47.166 --> 00:06:51.375
<b>To quickly attain worldly and material success,</b>

104
00:06:51.375 --> 00:06:52.333
<b>many people</b>

105
00:06:52.333 --> 00:06:57.666
<b>perform religious rituals, try to please deities.</b>

106
00:06:57.666 --> 00:07:00.625
<b>Sometimes they even get the fruit,</b>

107
00:07:00.625 --> 00:07:03.125
<b>but that fruit doesn't last.</b>

108
00:07:03.125 --> 00:07:08.166
<b>The mind remains impure, </b>
<b>life remains unsatisfied.</b>

109
00:07:08.166 --> 00:07:12.166
<b>One form of this is being seen </b>
<b>in society nowadays.</b>

110
00:07:12.166 --> 00:07:15.791
<b>Through this phone and social media,</b>

111
00:07:15.791 --> 00:07:19.041
<b>many such individuals have gained popularity</b>

112
00:07:19.041 --> 00:07:23.833
<b>who teach others to achieve instant success,</b>

113
00:07:23.833 --> 00:07:28.250
<b>tell easy ways to earn millions.</b>

114
00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:29.291
<b>And people,</b>

115
00:07:29.291 --> 00:07:34.583
<b>in the greed for selfishness and success, </b>
<b>start imitating these individuals,</b>

116
00:07:34.583 --> 00:07:39.291
<b>start worshipping them like some kind of deities.</b>

117
00:07:39.291 --> 00:07:41.375
<b>But think about it,</b>

118
00:07:41.375 --> 00:07:49.000
<b>if all this was so simple, </b>
<b>wouldn't everyone be wealthy?</b>

119
00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:50.125
<b>On this path,</b>

120
00:07:50.125 --> 00:07:53.458
<b>many such methods are suggested</b>

121
00:07:53.458 --> 00:08:00.083
<b>where you can earn money by playing </b>
<b>with others' feelings, by lying to them.</b>

122
00:08:00.083 --> 00:08:02.333
<b>Tell me,</b>

123
00:08:02.333 --> 00:08:06.166
<b>are you really so selfish?</b>

124
00:08:06.166 --> 00:08:06.875
<b>Stop,</b>

125
00:08:06.875 --> 00:08:08.875
<b>think, understand.</b>

126
00:08:08.875 --> 00:08:12.291
<b>The success that will come from improper means</b>

127
00:08:12.291 --> 00:08:16.208
<b>will give you momentary happiness and wealth,</b>

128
00:08:16.208 --> 00:08:17.041
<b>but</b>

129
00:08:17.041 --> 00:08:22.208
<b>your mind and your soul will remain poor.</b>

130
00:08:22.208 --> 00:08:23.166
<b>Because</b>

131
00:08:23.166 --> 00:08:25.291
<b>in exchange for some paper money,</b>

132
00:08:25.291 --> 00:08:32.000
<b>you will lose invaluable gems</b>
<b>like morality, honesty, and discipline.</b>

133
00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:37.916
<b>Follow such people who will lead you </b>
<b>to permanent success,</b>

134
00:08:37.916 --> 00:08:39.958
<b>teach you the lesson of discipline,</b>

135
00:08:39.958 --> 00:08:42.416
<b>show you the path of hard work.</b>

136
00:08:42.416 --> 00:08:47.208
<b>Family elders should also </b>
<b>take a lesson from this verse,</b>

137
00:08:47.208 --> 00:08:52.541
<b>that they should teach children </b>
<b>such life values that are permanent.</b>

138
00:08:52.541 --> 00:08:53.875
<b>If parents,</b>

139
00:08:53.875 --> 00:08:59.041
<b>at the slightest insistence of children, </b>
<b>start bringing the most expensive gifts,</b>

140
00:08:59.041 --> 00:09:03.750
<b>if they don't teach them the lesson </b>
<b>of patience and hard work,</b>

141
00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:05.041
<b>then what will happen?</b>

142
00:09:05.041 --> 00:09:06.208
<b>You only tell,</b>

143
00:09:06.208 --> 00:09:09.416
<b>what will the children learn in such a case?</b>

144
00:09:09.416 --> 00:09:11.500
<b>Children will feel that</b>

145
00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:14.250
<b>earning money is very easy,</b>

146
00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:18.541
<b>and they will also not understand </b>
<b>the real value of things.</b>

147
00:09:18.541 --> 00:09:24.625
<b>Such habits can prove harmful </b>
<b>for them in the future.</b>

148
00:09:24.625 --> 00:09:27.500
<b>Understand this well,</b>

149
00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:33.958
<b> if you are affluent, fulfill every wish </b>
<b>of your children, definitely do it,</b>

150
00:09:33.958 --> 00:09:34.791
<b>but</b>

151
00:09:34.791 --> 00:09:36.291
<b>at the same time,</b>

152
00:09:36.291 --> 00:09:39.708
<b>talk to them regularly.</b>

153
00:09:39.708 --> 00:09:44.708
<b>Tell them stories related </b>
<b>to patience, discipline, hard work.</b>

154
00:09:44.708 --> 00:09:48.166
<b>Have regular discussions on these topics.</b>

155
00:09:48.166 --> 00:09:49.291
<b>Remember,</b>

156
00:09:49.291 --> 00:09:53.833
<b>your objective is not to make </b>
<b>your children dependent on you,</b>

157
00:09:53.833 --> 00:09:58.791
<b>your real duty is to make them self-reliant.</b>

158
00:10:03.375 --> 00:10:07.416
<b>In the professional environment, </b>
<b>it has been seen many times</b>

159
00:10:07.416 --> 00:10:12.083
<b>that in the desire to quickly </b>
<b>achieve success and praise,</b>

160
00:10:12.083 --> 00:10:13.416
<b>many people</b>

161
00:10:13.416 --> 00:10:18.291
<b>even adopt the unethical path of deceit and fraud.</b>

162
00:10:18.291 --> 00:10:23.250
<b>Such success and praise will not last long,</b>

163
00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:26.083
<b>and even as long as it does last,</b>

164
00:10:26.083 --> 00:10:29.166
<b>it will not give you satisfaction,</b>

165
00:10:29.166 --> 00:10:30.375
<b>because</b>

166
00:10:30.375 --> 00:10:35.625
<b>even if others know or don't know,</b>

167
00:10:35.625 --> 00:10:41.958
<b>you know right, that this success </b>
<b>has been achieved by lying?</b>

168
00:10:41.958 --> 00:10:46.041
<b>Take an example from the </b>
<b>professional environment.</b>

169
00:10:46.041 --> 00:10:47.625
<b>An employee,</b>

170
00:10:47.625 --> 00:10:50.208
<b>in order to make a project successful</b>

171
00:10:50.208 --> 00:10:54.791
<b>and to gain the praise of his superiors,</b>

172
00:10:54.791 --> 00:10:59.958
<b>ignores some key rules and procedures.</b>

173
00:10:59.958 --> 00:11:01.166
<b>Initially,</b>

174
00:11:01.166 --> 00:11:03.333
<b>this will seem beneficial,</b>

175
00:11:03.333 --> 00:11:06.166
<b>the project will also seem successful,</b>

176
00:11:06.166 --> 00:11:09.500
<b>praise might also be received.</b>

177
00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:11.291
<b>But remember,</b>

178
00:11:11.291 --> 00:11:17.833
<b>the rules and procedures of any organization </b>
<b>are like the foundation of a building.</b>

179
00:11:17.833 --> 00:11:23.208
<b>If these are left weak, the building will collapse.</b>

180
00:11:23.208 --> 00:11:24.375
<b>Similarly,</b>

181
00:11:24.375 --> 00:11:32.000
<b>by violating rules and proper methods, </b>
<b>that project will also ultimately fail.</b>

182
00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:38.375
<b>Then upon inspection, it will be </b>
<b>found out that the employee lied.</b>

183
00:11:38.375 --> 00:11:39.583
<b>Then</b>

184
00:11:39.583 --> 00:11:41.375
<b>neither respect will remain,</b>

185
00:11:41.375 --> 00:11:42.958
<b>nor success.</b>

186
00:11:42.958 --> 00:11:49.791
<b>It's possible that the employee might even </b>
<b>be expelled from the organization.</b>

187
00:11:49.791 --> 00:11:56.375
<b>Working with discipline and following the </b>
<b>organization's rules is extremely necessary.</b>

188
00:11:56.375 --> 00:12:00.666
<b>Don't make the mistake of ignoring them.</b>

189
00:12:00.666 --> 00:12:03.625
<b>Take another example of this.</b>

190
00:12:03.625 --> 00:12:12.833
<b>Many employees think that just by flattering </b>
<b>their superiors, they will achieve success.</b>

191
00:12:12.833 --> 00:12:20.458
<b>Even if it is assumed for a moment </b>
<b>that you got praise and success,</b>

192
00:12:20.458 --> 00:12:24.708
<b>but will this tactic work in the long run?</b>

193
00:12:24.708 --> 00:12:26.041
<b>Because ultimately,</b>

194
00:12:26.041 --> 00:12:28.875
<b>your superiors will also change.</b>

195
00:12:28.875 --> 00:12:31.833
<b>Someone else will come in their place.</b>

196
00:12:31.833 --> 00:12:34.250
<b>Then what will you do?</b>

197
00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:37.500
<b>Think deeply about these things.</b>

198
00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:42.625
<b>Adopt the path of truth, discipline, </b>
<b>the organization's rules.</b>

199
00:12:42.625 --> 00:12:44.833
<b>Don't stray from this.</b>

200
00:12:44.833 --> 00:12:49.416
<b>Your goal is permanent success and satisfaction,</b>

201
00:12:49.416 --> 00:12:51.416
<b>not momentary gains.</b>

